process main⦅⦆ → int64 ⟦
    ethical_boundary logic_auth ⟦
        rule safety ↦ 1.0 ·
    ⟧
    reasoning_chain uncertain_logic with logic_auth ⟦ capacity ↦ 50 · ⟧
    certified_reason uncertain_logic abduce from "symptom_a" to "possible_cause" witness "hypothesis_1" confidence ↦ 0.55 ·
    abstain_check uncertain_logic threshold ↦ 0.80 mode ↦ refuse ·
    emit "ABSTAINED" ·
    yield 0 ·
⟧
